{"step_index":52,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T21:10:44Z","content":"JavaScript syntax is clean. Now let me create the deployment guide artifact:","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Complete guide for Brew & Bloom Café website: customisation steps (WhatsApp number, address, maps), local dev instructions, and three Vercel/Netlify deployment options. Also includes a full feature checklist and brand token reference.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# ☕ Brew & Bloom Café — Build & Deployment Guide\n\n## Project Location\n```\nC:\\Users\\Lenovo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\brew-and-bloom\\\n```\n\n## Files\n| File | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `index.html` | Complete single-page website — all 9 sections |\n| `style.css` | All styles — brand palette, layouts, animations, responsive |\n| `script.js` | All interactivity — WhatsApp, nav, tabs, scroll, hamburger |\n| `vercel.json` | Vercel deployment config with caching & security headers |\n| `package.json` | Local dev server (`npx serve`) |\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Before You Launch — Required Customisations\n\n### 1. WhatsApp Number (One place to change)\nOpen [`script.js`](file:///C:/Users/Lenovo/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/brew-and-bloom/script.js#L10-L14) and edit line 10:\n```js\nconst WHATSAPP_NUMBER = \"910000000000\"; // ← Change to your number\n// Format: country code + number, no +, spaces, or dashes\n// Example (India): \"919876543210\"\n```\nThis single change powers ALL WhatsApp order links across the entire site.\n\n### 2. Address, Phone & Hours\nSearch for `EDITABLE` in [`index.html`](file:///C:/Users/Lenovo/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/brew-and-bloom/index.html) — there are 5–6 blocks clearly marked.\n\n### 3. Google Maps Embed\nIn the Location section of `index.html`, find the `map-placeholder` div and replace with a real `<iframe>`:\n1. Go to [Google Maps](https://maps.google.com) → search your café location\n2. Click **Share** → **Embed a map** → copy the `src=\"...\"` URL\n3. Uncomment the `<iframe>` block in `index.html` and paste your src\n\n### 4. Social Media Links\nIn the footer, replace `href=\"#\"` on Instagram and Facebook links with your real profile URLs.\n\n### 5. Menu Prices\nPrices are inline in each `menu-card` in `index.html`. Search for `₹` to find all prices.\n\n---\n\n## 🖥️ Running Locally\n\n```powershell\ncd C:\\Users\\Lenovo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\brew-and-bloom\nnpx serve . -l 3000\n# → Open http://localhost:3000\n```\n\nOr just open `index.html` directly in your browser (double-click it).\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Deploying to Vercel\n\n### Option A — Vercel CLI (Recommended)\n\n```powershell\n# Install Vercel CLI (once)\nnpm install -g vercel\n\n# Navigate to project\ncd C:\\Users\\Lenovo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\brew-and-bloom\n\n# Deploy (follow prompts)\nvercel\n\n# For production deployment:\nvercel --prod\n```\n\nVercel will give you a URL like `https://brew-and-bloom-cafe.vercel.app`\n\n### Option B — Vercel Dashboard (No CLI)\n\n1. Push project to GitHub:\n```powershell\ncd C:\\Users\\Lenovo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\brew-and-bloom\ngit init\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"Initial commit: Brew & Bloom Café website\"\n# Create a GitHub repo, then:\ngit remote add origin https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/brew-and-bloom.git\ngit push -u origin main\n```\n\n2. Go to [vercel.com](https://vercel.com) → **Add New Project**\n3. Import your GitHub repository\n4. Framework preset: **Other** (or leave auto-detect)\n5. Click **Deploy** — done!\n\n> [!TIP]\n> The `vercel.json` already configures security headers and asset caching. No extra settings needed.\n\n### Option C — Netlify Drop\n\n1. Zip the project folder (excluding `node_modules`)\n2. Go to [app.netlify.com/drop](https://app.netlify.com/drop)\n3. Drag and drop the zip — live in seconds\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Feature Checklist\n\n| Feature | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Sticky navigation (scrolled state) | ✅ |\n| Mobile hamburger menu | ✅ |\n| Hero with animated headline | ✅ |\n| Smooth scroll to all sections | ✅ |\n| Menu with 5 category tabs | ✅ |\n| WhatsApp ordering (prefilled message per item) | ✅ |\n| About section with layered imagery | ✅ |\n| Photo gallery (masonry-style grid) | ✅ |\n| Bestsellers section | ✅ |\n| Location + opening hours | ✅ |\n| Google Maps placeholder (ready to replace) | ✅ |\n| Contact section with WhatsApp CTA | ✅ |\n| Footer with social links | ✅ |\n| Back to top button | ✅ |\n| Scroll reveal animations | ✅ |\n| Announcement marquee strip | ✅ |\n| Responsive (mobile / tablet / desktop) | ✅ |\n| SEO meta tags (description, OG, keywords) | ✅ |\n| Accessibility (ARIA roles, labels, focus) | ✅ |\n| No fake orders / no fake business data | ✅ |\n| Demo content clearly labelled | ✅ |\n| Vercel config with security headers | ✅ |\n| Zero paid APIs or unnecessary deps | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n## 🎨 Brand Tokens (CSS Variables in `style.css`)\n\n| Token | Value | Use |\n|---|---|---|\n| `--cream` | `#fdf6ed` | Background |\n| `--espresso` | `#3b1f0e` | Primary dark / headings |\n| `--latte` | `#8b5a2b` | Medium brown accents |\n| `--caramel` | `#c4721e` | Primary CTA / terracotta |\n| `--sage` | `#6b8e6b` | Sage green accents |\n| `--sand` | `#f0e4d0` | Card backgrounds |\n","Description":"Complete deployment guide and customisation reference for Brew & Bloom Café.","Overwrite":false,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Lenovo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\b76faff2-d711-4aab-931a-94ff7ee7f3a8\\brew-and-bloom-guide.md","toolAction":"Creating deployment guide","toolSummary":"Deployment guide artifact"}}]}
